### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Catalog
GET http://localhost:3000/tariffs/catalog?q=Repsol electricidad&company=Repsol&limit=5

### Basic deterministic calculation
POST http://localhost:3000/tariffs/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kwh": 350,
  "energyPrice": 0.1299,
  "powerKwP1": 4.6,
  "powerKwP2": 4.6,
  "powerPriceP1PerKwDay": 0.09013,
  "powerPriceP2PerKwDay": 0.09013,
  "days": 30
}

### Full bill estimate - replace tariffId with a real catalog id if needed
POST http://localhost:3000/tariffs/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tariffId": "repsol-electricidad-6",
  "kwh": 350,
  "powerKwP1": 4.6,
  "powerKwP2": 4.6,
  "days": 30,
  "useDiscountedPrices": true,
  "includePower": true
}
